    "updated_at": "2026-11-08T13:34:00Z",
    "body": "Reproduction checkpoint: the supplied face resolves correctly on 8f30bee (one outer ring and six closed hole rings); saved Trace generates 1060 moves and an equivalent Contour 679, both without warnings. Facing's default Lift mode fails with the same 15.15 mm gap / 3 mm tool contradiction reported more specifically in #260, using the same cutouts model.\r\n\r\nI am transferring implementation to #260, where the exact failure and acceptance criteria are documented, rather than claiming a fix for the broader GUI selection symptom I could not reproduce. #241 stays open and available; box selection is not implemented. Baseline evidence is preserved in the isolated issue-241-repro worktree and native issue241/repro artifacts.",
